  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the admit card for the recruitment of Lecturer (GIC) posts on its official website. This recruitment was released for 1516 posts. Applications for the UPPSC GIC Lecturer Recruitment 2025 were accepted from August 12, 2025, to September 12, 2026. The online examination is going to be conducted on 14 &amp; 17 June 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their UPPSC GIC Lecturer Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPPSC GIC Lecturer Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPPSC TGT Advt No : A-5/E-1/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>12 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>12 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>12 September 2025</strong></span></li